# D3-AD-003: Recover dye from a loaded adsorbent by changing the surrounding solution
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
add v1 water 30mL
add v1 methyl_orange 0.01g
add v1 activated_charcoal 0.10g
filter v1 v2
inspect
add v1 water 100mL
stir v1 200rpm 20s
filter v1 v3
measure v2 uvvis
measure v3 uvvis
look v1
inspect
